  "uncertain": [
    "Image 1 prints TXD(GPIO43) at pin 25 and RXD(GPIO44) at pin 27, while images 2 and 3 print RXD(GPIO44) at 25 and TXD(GPIO43) at 27; the images may show different board revisions/variants and the images do not name the product, so which applies to ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-3.5 is unclear."
  ],
  "notes": "Back view of a Waveshare display board with a 2x16 header and printed pin numbers. Labels use the GPIO name inside parentheses with the prefix (DN, DP, BOOT, TXD, RXD, SCL, SDA) in functions. Pin 8 is printed 'DP(DPIO20)' (likely typo for GPIO20); recorded as printed. Images 2 and 3 show the same header labels on slightly different board photos (image 3 shows a speaker fitted). Battery, speaker (SPK) connectors only have +/- marks and are skipped."
